Time Complexity:
d = number of digits in the largest number
O(n × d)

Space Complexity:
O(1)

Approach:
1. Initialize minSum as Integer.MAX_VALUE
2. Traverse each element of the array
3. Calculate the sum of its digits using modulo and division
4. Compare the digit sum with minSum
5. Update minSum if a smaller digit sum is found
6. After processing all elements, return minSum



class Solution {
    public int minElement(int[] nums) {
        int minSum = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
        for (int ele : nums) {
            int sum = 0;
            while (ele != 0) {
                sum += ele % 10;
                ele /= 10;
            }
            minSum = Math.min(minSum, sum);
        }
        return minSum;
    }
}
